; The asymmetry the continuation encoding relies on: a proper-tail call
; reuses the current activation and consumes no call context, so depth is
; bounded by neither the 256-context cap nor the hidden Alpha stack. 4,096
; tail calls, sixteen times the non-tail bound, complete in constant space.
(def descend ((n Int)) Int
  (if (eq n 0) 42 (descend (- n 1))))

(def main () Int (descend 4096))
